  # 10 Viral Hook Templates for 1M+ Views (2026 Guide)
  
  Short-form video now commands 82% of all internet traffic, with creators generating millions of views from perfectly crafted 30-second scripts.
  
  If you're still winging your scripts or wondering why your Reels aren't breaking through, you're about to discover the exact frameworks top creators use to consistently hit 1M+ views. The magic lies not in expensive equipment or production teams, but in understanding the psychology behind our [viral hook psychology techniques](https://virvid.ai/blog/viral-hook-psychology-2026-short-videos), mastering retention strategies, and deploying proven templates that stop thumbs mid-scroll.
  
