  ### ChatGPT vs Gemini vs Virvid - which AI tool is best for viral scripts?
  
  ChatGPT excels at creative hooks and natural conversation (40-60% time savings). Gemini provides better research and current data. [Virvid](https://virvid.ai/) offers the complete package with built-in viral templates, trending formats, and AI voices, no prompt engineering needed. Most pros use a combination depending on the task.
  
  ### What's the single best hook template for beginners?
  
  Start with 'Did you know that...' hooks, they've generated 22M+ views and work across all niches. They create instant curiosity gaps that viewers must close. Second best is '3 mistakes everyone makes about X' which triggers self-identification and doubles engagement rates consistently.
  
  ### How do I write scripts that work on TikTok AND Instagram Reels?
  
  Create a core script then adapt platform-specifically: TikTok needs 2-second hooks with 20% higher energy and trending sounds. Instagram wants 3-second hooks with polished aesthetics. Never cross-post with watermarks, algorithms penalize this by 40-60%. Write once, customize twice for best results.
  
